Archons resist fire, cold, lightning, sleep and poison, and are
generated with shields of reflection, making them immune to magic
missile.  You are being blinded and stunned by seeing the blessed
radiance of the Archon.

Blindfold yourself (so that you won't get *stunned* any more), use
telepathy to work out where it is, use magic missile to blast your
way through the horde, and use a nice meaty weapon to kill it.

Hopefully, his summonings will eventually yield either a cockatrice
(and then a cockatrice corpse) or a purple worm. Being only of size
MZ_LARGE, Archons are not immune to being swallowed whole. They are
also not immune to petrification, so whacking it with a cockatrice
corpse should do the trick, and they are not immune to paralysis, so
whacking it with a wielded potion of paralysis while you are wearing
a ring of free action will at least stop it from doing anything for
a while.
